<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Northern Irish league</p>
<p>premier division soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Ards	   1     Coleraine    4</p>
<p> Cliftonville 0     Glentoran    2</p>
<p> Glenavon     0     Crusaders    0</p>
<p> Linfield     1     Portadown    0</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>against, points): Coleraine 8 7 1 0 18 9 22</p>
<p> Linfield     8   3   3   2   11   8   12</p>
<p> Crusaders    8   3   3   2   11   8   12</p>
<p> Portadown    7   3   2   2   10  10   11</p>
<p> Glenavon     8   2   3   3   11  11    9</p>
<p> Glentoran    8   2   2   4   15  16    8</p>
<p> Ards	   8   2   1   5   11  17    7</p>
<p> Cliftonville 7   0   3   4    3  11    3</p>
</text>
